{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18722","headline":"咏史 · 柳宗元","name":"咏史","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"燕有黄金台，远致望诸君。\n嗛嗛事强怨，三岁有奇勳。\n悠哉辟疆理，东海漫浮云。\n宁知世情异，嘉谷坐熇焚。\n致令委金石，谁愿蠢蠕羣。\n风波歘潜构，遗恨意纷纭。\n岂不善图後，交私非所闻。\n爲忠不顾内，晏子亦垂文。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"柳宗元","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18722.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18722","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}